<!--
    Every user-visible string in the app, in English. Each of the eight other languages has a
    values-<qualifier>/ folder with the same names, and a string added here belongs in all of them:
    lint reports a MissingTranslation error for any it is missing from.

    Grouped by the screen that shows it, in roughly the order a user meets them.

    Text that depends on a number is a <plurals> resource, so every language can choose the right
    form for each count — Russian has four of them, Arabic six.
-->
